    "7b7f1b43-dfdc-55de-aa97-1d75566b69a7": {
      "type": "js.text",
      "props": {
        "content": "<p><strong>Important information.</strong> Northwind Pay Ltd is authorised by the Financial Conduct Authority as an Electronic Money Institution (FRN 900123) for the issuing of electronic money and provision of payment services. Northwind Pay is not a bank and your balance is not a deposit. Safeguarded funds are not protected by the Financial Services Compensation Scheme. Foreign exchange rates fluctuate and the value of a converted balance may fall as well as rise. Pricing shown is indicative and subject to your executed agreement. This page is provided for information only and does not constitute financial, legal or tax advice.</p>",
        "size": "small",
